<title>USA: Chieftain CEO upbeat on Marsh Island natgas.</title>
<headline>Chieftain CEO upbeat on Marsh Island natgas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chieftain International Inc's chief executive said Wednesday that a new natural gas find on Marsh Island in the Gulf of Mexico may add dramatically to Chieftain's natural gas output.</p>
<p>&quot;On Marsh Island, we have the potential for increasing production quite dramatically,&quot; Stanley Milner, president and chief executive officer, told Reuters at after a presentation at a conference here Wednesday morning.</p>
</text>
